# Custom AXI4-Stream Video Cropper IP

## Overview

This directory documents the custom AXI4-Stream video cropper developed as part of the FPGA-Based Video Cropping and Scaling Pipeline.

The cropper is a custom Verilog RTL module designed to extract a centered 1280×720 region from a 1920×1080 AXI4-Stream video input.

